# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# --- Required for live answers -------------------------------------------
# Without this the app still runs: the trail library, search, and replay all
# work, and /api/ask returns a clear "live answers are off" message rather
# than failing opaquely.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Optional: shared, persistent team memory -----------------------------
# Unset, Cairn uses an in-memory store: seeded on boot, resets when the server
# sleeps. Fine for a local run or a solo demo.
#
# Set both, and trails become genuinely shared across everyone hitting the
# deployment — which is what makes the team-memory half real rather than
# illustrative. Free tier is ample; create a database at https://upstash.com
# (or add the Upstash integration from the Vercel dashboard, which injects
# these two variables for you).
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://....upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...

# --- Optional: spend limits on live answers -------------------------------
# /api/ask is public and unauthenticated, so every model call it makes is
# billable by anyone who finds the URL. These three limits all apply, and only
# to actual model calls — recall hits are free and never counted.
#
# Defaults below are sized for a demo at roughly 3 cents per call: the daily
# cap bounds exposure near $3/day, which is enough for a reviewer to explore
# properly and low enough that a scraper can't drain the account overnight.
#
# Without Upstash these counters are per serverless instance and reset on cold
# start, so the effective ceiling is somewhat higher than configured. Good
# enough to stop runaway loops; set Upstash for a limit that genuinely holds.
# RATE_LIMIT_PER_IP_PER_MINUTE=6
# RATE_LIMIT_PER_IP_PER_HOUR=30
# RATE_LIMIT_GLOBAL_PER_DAY=100

# --- Optional: model tuning -----------------------------------------------
# Defaults are what measured best on real screenshots. Turning thinking off
# was tested and made no meaningful difference (4851ms vs 4936ms warm, same
# pointing accuracy), so the safer setting stays on.
# CAIRN_EFFORT=low          # low | medium | high
# CAIRN_THINKING=adaptive   # adaptive | disabled
